Pinned by tag + commit SHA (never a moving branch). To update: fetch
lib/linguist/languages.yml at the new tag/SHA, replace languages.yml + this file,
re-run `npm run generate:linguist`, and commit the regenerated catalog. The drift
check (npm run check:linguist-drift) fails if the committed catalog does not match
a fresh regeneration.
